{"id":"fino","lemma":"fino","pos":"adj","rank":4217,"glosses":["fine (particularly slender)","fine (consisting of especially minute particulate)","fine (of superior quality)"],"ipa":"/ˈfino/","forms":{"feminine":"fina","masculinePlural":"finos","femininePlural":"finas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-fino.wav","examples":[{"text":"Cae una lluvia fina.","en":"It's drizzling.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523640","words":[{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"rain"},null]},{"text":"El hielo es demasiado fino para soportar tu peso.","en":"The ice is too thin to bear your weight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733724","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"ice"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"too much"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"to bear"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"weight"}]},{"text":"Me gusta una pluma fina.","en":"I like a pen with a fine point.","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"feather"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"Esa muchacha tiene las facciones muy finas.","en":"That girl has very delicate features.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"boy or young adult","l":"muchacho"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"features"},null,null]},{"text":"Hay una fina línea entre el amor y el odio.","en":"There's a fine line between love and hate.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"line"},{"g":"between"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"love"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"hate"}]}]}